 bio-tech-edu-v6.patch               | 9141 ---------------------------
 bio-tech-edu-v6.zip                 |  Bin 2475170 -> 0 bytes
 8 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 9143 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 assets/blog/capa_dua_rea.png
 delete mode 100644 assets/blog/capa_eca_bncc.png
 delete mode 100644 assets/blog/capa_rea_plano_aula.png
 delete mode 100644 assets/blog/capa_stheam_cnt.png
