 blog/config.json           | 26 +++++++++---
 package.json               | 13 ++++--
 scripts/check-comments.mjs | 47 +++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 137 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 scripts/check-comments.mjs

